{
  "description": [
    "hitop sync test vectors for run reports and shared environment values (hitop-sync-crypto 0.5). Byte strings are lower-case hex; integers big endian; u16 lengths prefix every string (UTF-8).",
    "run report: XChaCha20-Poly1305 under the workspace key of `number` (the epoch); envelope = 0x01 || u32 epoch || nonce (24) || ciphertext || tag (16); aad = \"hitop-sync/v1/run\" || u16 len || workspaceId || u16 len || runId || u32 epoch",
    "share: XChaCha20-Poly1305 under the share's own 32-byte key; envelope = 0x01 || u32 version || nonce || ciphertext || tag; aad = \"hitop-sync/v1/env-share\" || u16 len || workspaceId || u16 len || shareId || u32 version; versions start at 1",
    "share wrap: HPKE RFC 9180 Auth mode, DHKEM(X25519, HKDF-SHA256), HKDF-SHA256, ChaCha20-Poly1305 (as format 2 workspace key wraps); info = \"hitop-sync/v1/env-share-wrap\" || u16 len || workspaceId || u16 len || shareId || u32 version || u16 len || senderKeyId || u16 len || recipientKeyId; aad empty; plaintext = the share key; wrapped = 0x02 || u32 version || u16 len || senderKeyId || enc (32) || sealed key (32) || tag (16)",
    "key pairs = DeriveKeyPair(ikm); wraps are checked in the open direction only (encapsulation is randomized); every entry in failures must fail (shareWrap failures open with shareWraps[0]'s recipient)"
  ],
